<title>UK: UK May non-EU trade deficit 563 mln stg.</title>
<headline>UK May non-EU trade deficit 563 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics released following seasonally adjusted UK non-EU Trade data-</p>
<p>    UK TRADE NON-EU (in million stg)    May	April (PREL Apr)</p>
<p>    Trade balance			-563     -425	(-335)</p>
<p>    Exports (FOB)			6,397     6,618   (6,636)</p>
<p>    Imports (FOB)			6,960     7,043   (6,971)</p>
<p>    Oil exports			  223	 241	 (242)</p>
<p>    Oil imports			  324	 408	 (410)</p>
<p>    Trade balance 3m ending	-1,639	N/A    (-1,467)</p>
<p>NOTE - Consensus forecast 530 million stg deficit.</p>
<p>TRADE VOLUME EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Import volume index (base 1990) 153.8    157.3   (156.6)</p>
<p>    Export volume index (base 1990) 146.9    149.7   (149.3)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)   3.0%    1.0%    (0.5%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (imps)   7.0%    4.0%    (4.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)   4.0%    4.0%    (4.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (exps)   9.5%    9.0%    (9.0%)</p>
<p>TRADE VALUE EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Balance (million stg)		-310     -325	(-259)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)   2.5%    UNCH    (-0.5%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)   3.5%    3.5%    (3.5%)</p>
</text>
